{"id":"vod_sn_37398","vodId":"37398","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"小林家的龙女仆","name_cn":"小林家的龙女仆","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1f7c1ec6f76891f095830f322f486d68.jpg"},"summary":"小林（田村睦心 配音）是一位非常平凡的程序员，在一次偶然之中救了一条名叫托尔（桑原由气 配音）的龙，为了报答小林的救命之恩，托尔化身成为了女仆的样子来到了小林家中，就这样，小林和龙女仆的同居生活就此拉开序幕。　　古灵精怪我行我素的康娜卡姆依（长绳麻理亚 配音）、对人类有着非常深的成见，但似乎不太聪明的样子的艾露玛（高田忧希 配音）、心思细腻温柔又稳重的大姐姐露科亚（高桥未奈美 配音）、痛恨着人类，但又无法自持的被人类所发明出来的游戏所吸引的法夫纳（小野大辅 配音），自托尔之后，小林的身边接二连三的出现了这些性格迥异的龙族们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MrnH5HdAHC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/33Ra9R3enK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N6xvDGmJM71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pbXqhxEMCH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w3hHMsaB1v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aXHpRtHETm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z1SMFMKWC11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZrhWJwc3M51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HyvpfiFccX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pB0cYdhdkg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rDTAeTjhjD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qMYwf1CsQq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kd1S631P8J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vLntmHugEw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15: